# DNA / protein data plane (uniform R/W)

**Gene:** `repo.engineering.dna_protein_data_plane.gen1`  
(Platform monorepo expands this; kit consumers use the same ladder when talking to AgentStack 8DNA.)

## Write ladder

1. Coalesced DiffOps → protein dirty journal / flush when available.
2. Leaf / `patch_paths` for one or few paths — never full JSON replace for a single field.
3. Secrets: protected column only.
4. Full blob only with ops preservation (`preserve_protein_ops` / prepare-full-blob).

## Never

Overwrite an entire project `data` document to change one nested key (fat-tenant gate + data loss risk).
